	doc "The core math library, plane: every check compares the result with a reference computed in double precision by a separate C implementation (Gauss-Jordan inverse, Rodrigues rotations, the GLM conventions), within 1e-5 of the larger of 1 and the reference's size; each line is the check's name and true."

